id: monster-form-controlled-monster
name: Controlled Monster
order: 3
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1, 2
# (2) Realization and M levels of Scaling.
aspects: +Realization, +Scaling (LV M), -Rampaging, +Rampaging (LV2)
# (3) "Ignore the effects of the Rampaging Aspect" - its level still counted (Monstrous Ascension (3)).
ignoresAspect: Rampaging
description: >
  With your mastery of your monstrous form, you have managed to rein in its vicious nature and take full control of your mind and body.
text: >
  Controlled Monster (1): With your mastery of your monstrous form, you have managed to rein in its vicious nature and take full control of your mind and body.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Your level for the Rampaging Aspect is set to 2.
  (2)-[Permanent]: Monster Form gains the Realization Aspect and M levels of the Scaling Aspect.
  (3)-[Passive]: Ignore the effects of the Rampaging Aspect.
  (4)-[Passive]: Increase your Combat Rolls by 1(T) while all of your Opponents are below the Bruised Health Threshold.

---

# (1)-(3) Its header. (4) Combat Rolls while every Opponent is below Bruised: the table's.
